# Product IA

Not a restyle of current front-office. Hierarchy: User → Company (account) → Project (1:N) → operational entities.

Entry: Login → **project list** → project. Billing, team, company settings live under the **avatar**, never in the project sidebar. No company-switcher for a normal user. No «Финансы» in project nav.

Do not recreate the old menu groups Products / Tools / Admin.

## Names

Never use bare «агент» or «бот».

| Object | Nav | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| AI-агент | AI-агенты | LLM persona. Channel: voice / chat / both |
| Сценарий | Сценарии | Flow on blocks |
| NLU-модель | NLU-модели | Intents/entities. Does not talk to the customer |
| Задание | Звонки | Outbound job. Card shows who speaks |
| Диалог | Чаты | Inbox thread |
| Рассылка | Рассылки | Campaign |
| Проект | list | |

Voice vs chat is a **channel**, not a bot type.

## Out of scope

Do not build: bot editor canvas, NLU trainer, super-admin, operator inbox as a product. Cards + links only. Operator login → blocked cabinet screen.
